            <!-- XP Gain: Tier 1 (Mild Hunger/Thirst: buffStatusHungry01/Thirsty01) - REMOVED AS PER DESIGN -->

            <!-- XP Gain: Tier 2 (Moderate Hunger/Thirst: buffStatusHungry02/Thirsty02) - COMMENTED OUT AS PER DESIGN -->
